      "Text": "……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000200,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "白子？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000210,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000220,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 1,
      "Text": "抱歉，不小心傳錯了"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000230,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "老師"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "我想到了一個非常好的點子"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "你趕快過來"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000260,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "雖然不太明白，我馬上過去！"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000270,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "啊，唔嗯"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000280,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "那個……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000290,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "等見面之後，我再跟你解釋"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000300,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "老師，大事不好了……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000310,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "我來這裡的時候帶了一件車衣過來，結果剛才試穿的時候"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000320,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "衣服的拉鍊……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000330,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "咦……！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000340,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000350,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "你別誤會"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000360,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "絕對不是我變胖了"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000370,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "唔嗯，這樣啊……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000380,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000390,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "晚安，老師"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000400,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "老師"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000410,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "如果方便的話"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000420,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "待會可以見個面嗎？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000430,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "怎麼了，白子？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000440,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "嗯"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000450,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "我有些煩惱想跟你商量……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000460,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "那當然沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000470,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 3,
      "Text": "嗯，謝謝你"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000480,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "比賽有結果了"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000490,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "比賽……！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "啊啊"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "嗯，雖然過程有點莫名"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "總之我們進行了公路賽的對決"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000530,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "公路賽！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000540,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "最後是誰贏了！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101000550,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "比賽的結果……"
    },
